The optimized preliminary self-test now finishes in under a second. At `easy` (two independent 48-bit semiprimes), the structure-aware language has no hits in 200,000 samples; all six non-tool attacks fail on 8/8 seeds; the exact SSB reference recovery solves 8/8 in a median 127 operations (148 maximum observed). I’m starting the script-owned bare oracle ladder now; its verdict will determine the actual shipping preset.
